 class=\"TableText\">22q12.1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.14%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>CHEK2</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.12%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">604373</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.14%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"9%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CHK2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.22%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"14%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Serine/threonine kinase involved in DNA damage response</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.22%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"15%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Breast, gastric, colon, thyroid, kidney, pancreas, prostate cancers; low-grade ovarian tumours; sarcoma; haematopoietic malignancies</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.62%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ovarian tumours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.2%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Diffuse gastric and lobular breast cancer syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.12%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">137215</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 6.1%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"6%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">AD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.12%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">16q22.1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.14%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>CDH1</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.12%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">192090</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.14%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"9%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">E-cadherin</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.22%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"14%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Calcium-dependent cell&ndash;cell adhesion</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.22%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"15%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Diffuse gastric cancer, lobular breast cancer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.62%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">n/a</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.2%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Peutz&ndash;Jeghers syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.12%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">175200</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 6.1%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"6%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">AD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.12%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">19p13.3</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.14%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>STK11</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.12%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5